# Installation


## Clone Repository


```bash
git clone <repository-url>

cd compliance-service
```


---

## Create Virtual Environment


```bash
python -m venv venv
```


Activate:


Windows:

```bash
venv\Scripts\activate
```


Linux/Mac:

```bash
source venv/bin/activate
```


---

## Install Dependencies


```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```


---

# Configuration


File:


```
app/core/config.py
```


Contains:


```python
OFAC_DOWNLOAD_URL

UN_DOWNLOAD_URL

EU_DOWNLOAD_URL

MATCH_THRESHOLD
```


Example:


```python
MATCH_THRESHOLD = 90
```


---


# Running Application


Start FastAPI:


```bash
python -m uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```


Server:


```
http://127.0.0.1:8000
```


Swagger documentation:


```
http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs
```


OpenAPI:


```
http://127.0.0.1:8000/openapi.json
```


