```


Tests cover:


- Exact match
- Fuzzy match
- UN entity detection
- EU entity loading
- Duplicate sources
- Empty input
- Special characters
- Case insensitive matching
- Bulk screening
- Refresh change detection


---


# Performance


Current design:


- Loads sanctions into memory during startup
- Creates normalized search index
- Uses RapidFuzz optimized matching


Benefits:


- Fast screening
- No database lookup for every request
- Supports bulk screening


---


