# Summary


This Compliance Service provides an automated sanctions screening platform capable of:

✔ Loading OFAC, UN, and EU sanctions lists  
✔ Parsing CSV and XML sources  
✔ Matching names intelligently  
✔ Supporting aliases  
✔ Detecting duplicate entities  
✔ Returning confidence scores  
✔ Handling bulk screening  
✔ Maintaining audit logs  
✔ Refreshing sanctions data automatically  

